  "prefLabel": "En 705.01 Construction and Maintenance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 705.01 Construction and Maintenance. Each sewer utility shall construct, install, operate, and maintain its plant, structures, equipment, and mains in accordance with good engineering practice, and in such manner to best accommodate the public, and to prevent interference with service furnished by other underground or above ground facilities, including electric, telephone, water, gas, or steam equipment or facilities, insofar as practical.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
